_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T15:17:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T15:17:52Z","body":"It should be up to date, does the documented solution work? ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172705076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172712813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172712813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172712813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69G8Ft","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T15:29:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T15:30:58Z","body":"I'm sorry, my writing may have been unclear. Let me rephrase:\n\nThe page you linked claims that ThorVG can't rasterize text in Svg-images, and recommends converting text to curves.\nThat obviously works, since ThorVG can draw curves. But for most projects the text you want to display is dynamic and converting it to static curves using inkscape is not an option: The content of the text changes during gameplay.\n\nBut this shouldn't be a problem: ThorVg can actually rasterize text elements in Svg-images (contradicting what it says in the linked documentation). You can quickly test this for yourself by creating an SVG-file with a text element inside of it (ie: \n`<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">`\n`<text x=\"100\" y=\"100\">text</text>`\n`</svg>`\n) and loading it with the online ThorVG viewer (https://www.thorvg.org/viewer). Looking at the changelogs it seems Godot switched to ThorVg 15 some time ago, so the rasterizing of text elements should be supported in 4.4.1.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172712813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172721488","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172721488","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172721488,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69G-NQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T15:40:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T15:40:59Z","body":"I suspect it might be due to the font not being identified, might need an explicitly declared font to resolve it, or might require an embedded font, the viewer probably has access to online fonts etc. that the engine doesn't (it only comes bundled with the standard editor fonts and access to system fonts)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172721488/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172735989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172735989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172735989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HBv1","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:02:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:02:18Z","body":"Only subset of ThorVG is included, we are not building a part of ThorVG that is used for rendering text. ThorVG text processing seems to be extremely limited and not capable of rendering any complex text, so not sure if there's any reason to include it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172735989/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172747810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172747810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172747810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HEoi","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:22:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:22:29Z","body":"The current version of thorvg seems to have pretty decent text rendering: \n\n<img width=\"340\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4952a06-dcce-4225-a01b-98fbf883f3a2\" />\n\nThorvg already only implements a subset of Svg to stay small, would it maybe be possible to include all of it? Otherwise Godots Svg capabilities might be a bit limited. Also the documentation should probably reflect which parts of ThorVg are included, or users will run into bugs that they’ll find hard to diagnose.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172747810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172758485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172758485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172758485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HHPV","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:42:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:42:18Z","body":"> The current version of thorvg seems to have pretty decent text rendering\n\nEverything in this picture is simple layouts and require no complex processing (just look up characters one-by-one and draw, which is what ThorVG code seems to be doing, at least this what it looks at the first glance), try rendering Arabic, Hebrew, Devanagari or any other text with ligatures or context dependent elements.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172758485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172761947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172761947","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172761947,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HIFb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T16:48:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T16:48:52Z","body":"If we want to include it, we probably should make our own implementation of `Text::Impl` backend that will plug in into Godot TextServer to do processing and supply ThorVG with glyph outline to render.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172761947/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172770776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172770776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172770776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HKPY","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T17:04:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T17:06:42Z","body":"> > The current version of thorvg seems to have pretty decent text rendering\n> \n> Everything in this picture is simple layouts and require no complex processing (just look up characters one-by-one and draw, which is what ThorVG code seems to be doing, at least this what it looks at the first glance), try rendering Arabic, Hebrew, Devanagari or any other text with ligatures or context dependent elements.\n\nI’m not sure if I understand the first part of your comment: Thorvgs shape drawing capabilities are also rather limited (you cant use filters for example), and can be reproduced by using godot Draw functions, but we still include it.\n I agree that the lack of support for any scripts but a pretty limited subset sucks, but I think linear Left-to-right text would still be sufficiënt for a ton of usecases. \n\nI can’t comment on the viability of supplying the glyphs from the Godot textserver, but I think at that point you’d also have to hook into the Thor Svg-parser to get font information? And are you proposing that the Godot textserver converts the text to curves for Thorvg to render? Wouldn’t that back-and-forth have pretty significant performance implications?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172770776/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172831360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172831360","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172831360,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HZCA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T19:02:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T19:02:16Z","body":"For anything but dynamic image processing the solution would be to use inkscape which gives good results, but limiting to latin scripts and linear left to right is extremely limiting and we shouldn't favor only that IMO, a half baked solution that skips a large part of the target audience is inappropriate considering how much of the rest of the engine is not limited in that way\n\nThere wouldn't be a lot of back-and-forth if using the text server, not any more than UI and text processing already does I'd say, I don't think ThorVG would be significantly faster even if the features would be improved","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172831360/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172869596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172869596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172869596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HiXc","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T20:20:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T20:20:27Z","body":"\n> For anything but dynamic image processing the solution would be to use inkscape which gives good results, but limiting to latin scripts and linear left to right is extremely limiting and we shouldn't favor only that IMO, a half baked solution that skips a large part of the target audience is inappropriate considering how much of the rest of the engine is not limited in that way\n> \n> There wouldn't be a lot of back-and-forth if using the text server, not any more than UI and text processing already does I'd say, I don't think ThorVG would be significantly faster even if the features would be improved\n\nI think this argument is applicable in the context of text in UIs, where text has meaning and needs to be localized. But there's a whole class of games where text is explicitly symbolic / decorative: Roguelikes. Here text-characters essentially function as sprites, and people often limit themselves to latin script (or even just ascii). \n\nThe limited amount of text-rendering that ThorVg supports is still sufficient for text-mode in roguelikes, while being much more flexible than Labels, and much more performant (in my experience) than _draw().\n\nI think including all of Thorvg now, and improving it with Bruvgz suggestion in the future could work great. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172869596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172872634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172872634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172872634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69HjG6","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T20:27:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T20:27:16Z","body":"> But there's a whole class of games where text is explicitly symbolic / decorative\n\nFor cases like this, it's better to convert text to paths. And if you are generating text dynamically, you can use `draw` methods or labels to have more control.\n\nSimply enabling this part of ThorVG code won't work, it will require some level of integration to load fonts from Godot resources, and you'll need to include these fonts with the project. Which a lot of people will forget to do, so it will cause more issues without adding any real benefits.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172872634/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172888421","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109493#issuecomment-3172888421","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109493","id":3172888421,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69Hm9l","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T21:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-10T21:01:13Z","body":"> > But there's a whole class of games where text is explicitly symbolic / decorative\n> \n> For cases like this, it's better to convert text to paths. And if you are generating text dynamically, you can use `draw` methods or labels to have more control.\n> \n> Simply enabling this part of ThorVG code won't work, it will require some level of integration to load fonts from Godot resources, and you'll need to include these fonts with the project. Which a lot of people will forget to do, so it will cause more issues without adding any real benefits.\n\nAs I say in my comment, labels and draw methods can be much less flexible and performant in these circumstances.\n\n I appreciate that getting Svg text-elements to work would be a lot of work, but I do really want to push back on the notion that Svg text is some niche issue that is appropiately served by this Inkscape work-around. \nDynamic Vector text is a huge part of what makes Svg useful.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172888421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]